songs.content:
[Bait 1]
L: Away in a manger no crib for a bed;
L: The little Lord Jesus lay down His sweet head.
L: The stars in the sky looked down where He lay;
L: The little Lord Jesus asleep on the hay.

[Bait 2]
L: The cattle are lowing the baby awakes;
L: But little Lord Jesus no crying He makes.
L: I love Thee, Lord Jesus, look down from the sky;
L: And stay by my cradle till morning is nigh.

[Bait 3]
L: Be near me, Lord Jesus, I ask Thee to stay;
L: Close by me forever and love me I pray.
L: Bless all the dear children in Thy tender care;
L: And take us to heaven to live with Thee there.

[Reff 1]
L: Praise God, from whom all blessings flow;
L: Praise Him, all creatures here below;
L: Praise Him above, ye heavenly host.
L: Praise Father, Son and Holy Ghost.
L: Amen.

[Reff 1]
L: Love so divine, love so sublime,
L: Love that is deeper than any sean;
L: Love for us all, oh, how can it be!

[Bait 1]
L: It was love that sent a Savior
L: To this world of sin and woe,
L: It was love that left Heaven's portals,
L: And came down to dwell below;
L: It was love that stilled the waters
L: On the stormy Galilee;
L: It was love that paid sin's ransom,
L: One dark day on Calvary.

[Bait 2]
L: It was love that heard my pleadings
L: When I cried out in my sin;
L: It was love that gave me comfort;
L: It was love that took me in;
L: It was love that whispered softly,
L: "I will never cast you out,"
L: It was love that eased my heartache;
L: It was love removed my doubt.

[Bait 3]
L: It is love that still is knocking
L: At the hearts of sinful men;
L: It is love that never tires,
L: But that knocks and knocks again;
L: It is love that solves all problems
L: In this world of care and strife;
L: It is love, the love Jesus,
L: That gives hope, and peace and life.

[Bait 1]
L: Praise the Lord! ye heav'ns, adore Him;
L: Praise Him, angels, in the height;
L: Sun and moon, rejoice before Him;
L: Praise Him, all ye stars of light.
L: Praise the Lord! for He hath spoken.
L: Worlds His mighty voice obeyed;
L: Laws which never shall be broken
L: For their guidance He hath made.

[Bait 2]
L: Praise the Lord! For He is glorious;
L: Never shall His promise fail;
L: God hath made His saints victorious;
L: Sin and death shall not prevail.
L: Praise the God of our salvation!
L: Hosts on high, His power proclaim;
L: Heaven, and earth and all creation,
L: Laud and magnify His name.

[Bait 3]
L: Worship, honor, glory, blessing,
L: Lord, we offer unto Thee;
L: Young and old, Thy praise expressing,
L: In glad homage bend the knee;
L: All the saints in heaven adore Thee;
L: We would bow before Thy throne.
L: As Thine angels serve before Thee,
L: So on earth Thy will be done.

[Bait 1]
L: This is my Father's world,
L: And to my listening ears;
L: All nature sings and round me rings
L: The music of the spheres.
L: This is my Father's world;
L: I rest me in the thought
L: Of rocks and trees, of skies and seas;
L: His hand the wonders wrought.

[Bait 2]
L: This is my Father's world;
L: The birds their carols raise.
L: The morning light, the lily white,
L: Declare their Maker's praise;
L: This is my Father's world;
L: He shines in all that's fair;
L: In the rustling grass I hear Him pass,
L: He speaks to me everywhere.

[Bait 3]
L: This is my Father's world,
L: O let me ne'er forget
L: That though the wrong seems oft so strong,
L: God is the Ruler yet.
L: This is my Father's world;
L: The battle is not done;
L: Jesus, who died, shall be satisfied,
L: And earth and heaven be one.

[Reff 1]
L: What a wonderful Savior,
L: Is Jesus my Jesus!
L: What a wonderful Savior,
L: Is Jesus my Lord!

[Bait 1]
L: Christ has for sin atonement made;
L: What a wonderful Savior!
L: We are redeemed, the price is paid;
L: What a wonderful Savior!

[Bait 2]
L: I praise Him for the cleansing blood;
L: What a wonderful Savior!
L: That reconciled my soul to God;
L: What a wonderful Savior!

[Bait 3]
L: He cleansed my heart from all its sin;
L: What a wonderful Savior!
L: And now He reigns and rules therein;
L: What a wonderful Savior!

[Bait 4]
L: He gives me overcoming power;
L: What a wonderful Savior!
L: And triumph in each trying hour;
L: What a wonderful Savior!

[Bait 5]
L: To Him I've given all my heart;
L: What a wonderful Savior!
L: The world shall never share a part;
L: What a wonderful Savior!

[Bait 6]
L: He walks beside me in the way;
L: What a wonderful Savior!
L: And keeps me faithful day by day;
L: What a wonderful Savior!

[Bait 1]
L: Walau dosamu merah akan putih dan bersih;
L: Walau dosamu merah akan putih dan bersih.
L: Walaupun merah bak kirmizi, ‘kan putih bersih.
L: Walau dosamu merah, walau dosamu merah;
L: akan putih dan bersih, akan putih dan bersih.

[Bait 2]
L: Dengar suara menghimbau: “Hai, kembali padaKu”;
L: Dengar suara menghimbau: “Hai, kembali padaKu”;
L: Sangat besar kasih-sayangNya, agung dan ajaib
L: Dengar suara menghimbau, dengar suara menghimbau:
L: “Hai, kembali padaKu; Hai, kembali padaKu”.

[Bait 3]
L: Tuhan mau mengampuni, melupakan dosamu;
L: Tuhan mau mengampuni, melupakan dosamu;
L: “Pandanglah Aku, wahai umat!”, sabda Tuhanmu.
L: Tuhan mau mengampuni, Tuhan mau mengampuni,
L: melupakan dosamu, melupakan dosamu.

[Bait 1]
L: Ya Tuhanku, kasihanilah daku;
L: Ya Tuhanku, kasihanilah daku.

[Bait 1]
L: Ya Tuhanku, ya Tuhanku, kasihani daku;
L: Ya Tuhanku, ya Tuhanku, kasihani daku;
L: Ya Tuhanku, ya Tuhanku, kasihani daku.

[Bait 1]
L: Syukur padaMu, ya Allah, atas s’gala rahmatMu;
L: Syukur atas kecukupan dari kasihMu penuh.
L: Syukur atas pekerjaan, walau tubuhpun lemban;
L: Syukur atas kasih sayang dari sanak dan teman.

[Bait 2]
L: Syukur atas bunga mawar, harum, indah tak terp’ri.
L: Syukur atas awan hitam dan mentari berseri.
L: Syukur atas suka-duka yang ‘Kau b’ri tiap saat;
L: Dan FimanMulah pelita agar kami tak sesat

[Bait 3]
L: Syukur atas keluarga penuh kasih yang mesra;
L: Syukur atas perhimpunan yang memb’ri sejahtera.
L: Syukur atas kekuatan kala duka dan kesah;
L: Syukur atas pengharapan kini dan selamaNya!

[Bait 1]
L: Tuhan, ambil hidupku dan kuduskan bagiMu;
L: pun waktuku pakailah memujiMu s’lamanya.

[Bait 1]
L: Di dalam Kristus bertemu seluruh dunia;
L: terpadu umat Penebus di dalam kasihNya.
L: Semua hati terlebur di dalam tubuhNya,
L: berkarya akrab dan tekun di pelayananNya.

[Bait 2]
L: Bergandeng tanganlah erat apa pun bangsamu;
L: pengabdi Bapa yang kudus, tentulah kawanku.
L: Di dalam Kristus bertemu seluruh dunia;
L: cerminan kasih penebus umatNya yang esa.

[Bait 1]
L: Mari semua, mari sembah Tuhan;
L: mari semua, mari sembah Tuhan;
L: mari semua, mari sembah Tuhan;
L: mari sujud menyembah.
